.DS_Store
.idea/

.claude/settings.local.json

# temporary documents
docs/issues/*
!docs/issues/CURRENT_ISSUES.md
!docs/issues/REFACTORING_CHECKLIST.md
!docs/issues/REFACTORING_PLAN.md

# environment variables
.env

# benchmark results
benchmark_results.txt

bin/

